Package: libghostty-gtk-1-0
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: GTK4 terminal widget on Ghostty's terminal engine
 libghostty-gtk is a GTK4 terminal widget on libghostty-vt, Ghostty's
 terminal engine, with the part of VTE's Vte.Terminal API that elementary
 Terminal uses. libghostty-vt is linked in statically.
 .
 This package contains the shared library and its GSettings schema.

Package: libghostty-gtk-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libghostty-gtk-1-0 (= ${binary:Version}),
         libglib2.0-dev,
         libgtk-4-dev,
         libpango1.0-dev,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: GTK4 terminal widget on Ghostty's terminal engine - development files
 libghostty-gtk is a GTK4 terminal widget on libghostty-vt, Ghostty's
 terminal engine, with the part of VTE's Vte.Terminal API that elementary
 Terminal uses.
 .
 This package contains the header, the Vala API and the pkg-config file
 (ghostty-gtk-1).
